--
-- NOTION: Level 1 explained what Notion is and how sharing works, then
-- Level 2 jumped straight to databases. Nothing covered navigating a
-- workspace or writing a page -- the two things a learner does every day
-- before they ever build a database. Both videos are from Notion's own
