--
-- A NOTE ON THE SEARCH THAT FOUND THEM: earlier queries for Notion
-- returned only third-party creators and the conclusion "no official
-- channel" would have been wrong -- day 8 had already used six videos
-- from the "Notion" channel. Verifying against the course's existing
-- lesson ids surfaced the channel that keyword search had missed. Check
-- what a course already uses before concluding a vendor does not publish.
