-- AFTER EFFECTS: Level 1 covered the interface and keyframes. It gains
-- parenting and null objects -- the concept that separates animation you
-- can edit from animation you have to redo -- and essential compositing.
-- Both from Adobe Video, Adobe's own channel.
--
